  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e67e23\">斜角墙</span></a></h1>\n<p>这是一个专为 Better Minecraft 4 设计的简单模组，用于修复由斜角墙模组添加的部分损坏的墙壁。</p>\n<p>通过用新的墙壁覆盖它们来实现修复。</p>\n<p>具体修复的墙壁包括：</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界（Aether）</a> </span>气凝胶墙</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界复兴（Aether Redux）</a></span>抛光赛特岩墙</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克（Quark）</a></span>米尔石和米尔石砖墙</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
